			{id=27621,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; Menial Laborers quickly become a threat as they survive, due to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:422682|h[Crude Weapons]|h|r.\n$bullet; Ol' Waxbeard's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:422246|h[Rock Buster]|h|r causes the target to take increased Physical damage for a brief period."},
			{id=27622,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:422162|h[Luring Candleflame]|h|r draws all Menial Laborers to focus the target.\n$bullet; Ol' Waxbeard's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:422150|h[Reckless Charge]|h|r, the resulting |cFF2959D3|Hspell:422270|h[Cave-In]|h|r, and speeding minecarts all instantly kill Menial Laborers."},
