		order=0,
		name="E.D.N.A.",
		lore="Defense protocols engaged! Earthen Defense and Neutralization Automaton is active. Informal nomenclature: E.D.N.A. This golem has contingencies for any potential intruder. Killing skardyn is its primary directive, but any unauthorized intuder is sufficient for a lethal response.",
