			{id=27930,title="Tank",body="$bullet;  Prioress Murrpray inflicts increased Holy damage while affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:423539|h[Inner Fire]|h|r.\n$bullet;  Arathor Devoted inflict Holy damage to nearby players while affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:425022|h[Overwhelming Power]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={1,2}},
