			{itemID=221079,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=221084,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=28087,title="Overview",body="Skarmorak assaults players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:422233|h[Crystalline Smash]|h|r forming |cFF2959D3|Hspell:422261|h[Crystal Shards]|h|r. Occasionally, Skarmorak unleashes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:423538|h[Unstable Crash]|h|r sending |cFF2959D3|Hspell:423557|h[Unstable Fragments]|h|r hurtling towards players. Upon depleting its energy, Skarmorak bolsters itself with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:423200|h[Fortified Shell]|h|r."},
			{id=28096,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Skarmorak draws power from Crystal Shards, bolstering |cFF2959D3|Hspell:423200|h[Fortified Shell]|h|r.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:423557|h[Unstable Fragments]|h|r increases healing, and damage dealt to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:423228|h[Fortified Shell]|h|r, but also inflicts Shadow Damage."},
			{id=28097,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:423557|h[Unstable Fragments]|h|r increases healing, and damage dealt to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:423228|h[Fortified Shell]|h|r, but also inflicts Shadow Damage.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:423324|h[Void Discharge]|h|r inflicts Shadow damage until Fortified Shell is broken."},
			{id=28098,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; Skarmorak inflicts heavy Physical damage to its current target with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:422233|h[Crystalline Smash]|h|r.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:423557|h[Unstable Fragments]|h|r increases healing, and damage dealt to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:423228|h[Fortified Shell]|h|r, but also inflicts Shadow Damage."},
			{id=28090,title="Section 3"},
			{id=28093,title="Section 4"},
			{id=28088,title="Section 2"},
			{id=28476,title="Crystal Shard"},
			{id=28477,title="Section 13"},
			{id=29043,title="Section 14"},
			{id=28094,title="Section 5"},
			{id=29585,title="Section 15",body="$[!8,23\n\nOn Mythic, these fragments form motes of|cFF2959D3|Hspell:435813|h[Unstable Energy]|h|r. $]"},
