		},
		sections={
			{id=28178,title="Overview",body="Anub'ikkaj patrols the streets of Mereldar, strengthened through |cFF2959D3|Hspell:427192|h[Empowered Might]|h|r from his nerubian lieutenants. Each of his allies grants formidable power while alive."},
			{id=28179,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:426860|h[Dark Orb]|h|r's final explosion inflicts less damage the farther it travels.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:426787|h[Shadowy Decay]|h|r inflicts substantial damage to all players."},
			{id=28180,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:426860|h[Dark Orb]|h|r's final explosion inflicts less damage the farther it travels.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:427001|h[Terrifying Slam]|h|r inflicts substantial damage and knocks back, fearing other players caught near the primary target."},
			{id=28181,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:426860|h[Dark Orb]|h|r's final explosion inflicts less damage the farther it travels.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:427001|h[Terrifying Slam]|h|r inflicts substantial damage and fears other players caught near the primary target."},
			{id=28183,title="Empowered Nerubians",body="Anub'ikkaj gains increased power from his nerubian lieutenants: Ascendant Vis'coxria, Deathscreamer Iken'tak, and Ixkreten the Unbreakable. Defeating them removes this power."},
