			{itemID=226683,diffs={8,23},faction=-1},
			{itemID=221093,diffs={101},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=28202,title="Overview",body="Void Speaker Eirich begins the encounter by tearing open 2 |cFF2959D3|Hspell:427315|h[Void Rift]|h|r. Periodically, the Void Speaker will afflict players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:427329|h[Void Corruption]|h|r which can only be removed by moving close to an active |cFF2959D3|Hspell:427315|h[Void Rift]|h|r."},
			{id=28203,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; The damage of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:427329|h[Void Corruption's]|h|r increases over time until it is removed.\n$bullet; Touching the center of a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:427315|h[Void Rift]|h|r inflicts lethal damage."},
			{id=28204,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; The damage of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:427329|h[Void Corruption's]|h|r increases over time until it is removed.\n$bullet; Touching the center of a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:427315|h[Void Rift]|h|r inflicts lethal damage."},
			{id=28205,title="Healers",body="$bullet; The damage of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:427329|h[Void Corruption's]|h|r increases over time until it is removed.\n$bullet; Touching the center of a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:427315|h[Void Rift]|h|r inflicts lethal damage."},
			{id=28206,title="Section 8",body="$[!23, 8\n\nOn Mythic difficulty, Void Rifts move to a new location upon consuming |cFF2959D3|Hspell:427329|h[Void Corruption]|h|r.$]"},
