			{itemID=224424,diffs={101},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=28435,title="Overview",body="Goldie Baronbottom uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:435567|h[Spread the Love!]|h|r to launch Cinderbrew Bombs into the area. Goldie's weapon attacks can set nearby Cimderbrew Bombs alight.\n\nUpon reaching 100 energy, Goldie Baronbottom casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:435622|h[Let It Hail!]|h|r detonating any remaining Cinderbrew Bombs."},
			{id=28790,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:435622|h[Let It Hail]|h|r detonates any remaining Cinderbrew Bombs.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:436592|h[Cash Cannon]|h|r ignites nearby Cinderbrew Bombs, causing them to explode.",difficultyIDs={1,2}},
			{id=28436,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:435622|h[Let It Hail]|h|r detonates any remaining Cinderbrew Bombs.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:435789|h[Cindering Wounds]|h|r iinflicts heavy Fire damage over a short duration to all players for each Cinderbrew Bomb that detonates.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:436592|h[Cash Cannon]|h|r ignites nearby Cinderbrew Bombs, causing them to explode.",difficultyIDs={8,23}},
			{id=28791,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:435622|h[Let It Hail]|h|r detonates any remaining Cinderbrew Bombs.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:436640|h[Burning Ricochet]|h|r bounces to nearby players and Cinderbrew Bombs.",difficultyIDs={1,2}},
			{id=28437,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:435622|h[Let It Hail]|h|r detonates any remaining Cinderbrew Bombs.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:435789|h[Cindering Wounds]|h|r iinflicts heavy Fire damage over a short duration to all players for each Cinderbrew Bomb that detonates.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:436640|h[Burning Ricochet]|h|r bounces to nearby players and Cinderbrew Bombs.",difficultyIDs={8,23}},
			{id=28792,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:435622|h[Let It Hail]|h|r detonates any remaining Cinderbrew Bombs and inflicts heavy Physical damage to all players.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:436640|h[Burning Ricochet]|h|r inflicts heavy Fire damage over time to afflicted players.",difficultyIDs={1,2}},
			{id=28438,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:435622|h[Let It Hail]|h|r detonates any remaining Cinderbrew Bombs and inflicts heavy Physical damage to all players.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:435789|h[Cindering Wounds]|h|r iinflicts heavy Fire damage over a short duration to all players for each Cinderbrew Bomb that detonates.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:436640|h[Burning Ricochet]|h|r inflicts heavy Fire damage over time to afflicted players.",difficultyIDs={8,23}},
			{id=28439,title="Stage One: <PH>",body="$[!8,23,\n\nOn Mythic difficulty, some Cinderbrew Bombs are replaced with Volatile Barrels.$]"},
			{id=28730,title="Section 7",body="$[!8,23,\n\nOn Mythic difficulty, detonating a Volatile Barrel afflicts all players with Cindering Wounds.$]"},
			{id=28729,title="Section 6",difficultyIDs={8,23}},
			{id=28762,title="Section 8"},
			{id=28740,title="Section 10"},
			{id=28739,title="Section 9"},
		},
	},
	[2590]={
		encounterID=2590,
		instanceID=1269,
		order=0,
		name="Master Machinists",
		lore="Master Machinists focus on complex work at prestigious worksites. Brokk and Dorlita have worked as a team for as long as anyone can remember. Granted, Brokk's productivity is slipping, but both are authorized to defend their site with direct and efficient displays of violence.",
		dungeonEncounterID=2888,
		uiMapID=2341,
		pin={x=0.2195,y=0.747},
		difficultyIDs={1,2,8,23,205},
		npcIDs={213216,213217},
		displayIDs={115818,121903},
		loot={
			{itemID=219301,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=219302,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=221085,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=221088,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=221087,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=221086,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=28458,title="Overview",body="Speakers Brokk and Dorlita unleash a calculated assault of metal and flame, using abilites like |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428161|h[Molten Metal]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:449169|h[Lava Cannon]|h|r and even activating |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428819|h[Exhaust Vents]|h|r to fill the area with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:429999|h[Flaming Scrap]|h|r.\n\nBrokk periodically uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428202|h[Scrap Song]|h|r to conjure and launch a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428547|h[Scrap Cube]|h|r, which Dorlita then locks onto for an explosive |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428508|h[Blazing Crescendo]|h|r."},
			{id=28463,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; When one Speaker is defeated before the other, the surviving Speaker empowers themselves with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:439577|h[Silenced Speaker]|h|r.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428161|h[Molten Metal]|h|r damages and slows all players unless interrupted.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428120|h[Lava Cannon]|h|r, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428547|h[Scrap Cube]|h|r, and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428535|h[Blazing Crescendo]|h|r inflict heavy damage to players who fail to avoid them."},
			{id=28464,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428161|h[Molten Metal]|h|r damages and slows all players unless interrupted.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428535|h[Blazing Crescendo]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:443954|h[Exhaust Vents]|h|r inflict significant damage to all party members. \n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428120|h[Lava Cannon]|h|r, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428547|h[Scrap Cube]|h|r, and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428535|h[Blazing Crescendo]|h|r inflict heavy damage to players who fail to avoid them."},
			{id=28465,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; When one Speaker is defeated before the other, the surviving Speaker empowers themselves with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:439577|h[Silenced Speaker]|h|r.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428161|h[Molten Metal]|h|r damages and slows all players unless interrupted.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428120|h[Lava Cannon]|h|r, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428547|h[Scrap Cube]|h|r, and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428535|h[Blazing Crescendo]|h|r inflict heavy damage to players who fail to avoid them."},
			{id=28932,title="Section 16"},
			{id=28459,title="Speaker Brokk"},
			{id=30382,title="Section 14"},
			{id=30383,title="Section 15",body="$[!8,23\n\nOn Mythic difficulty Flaming Scrap lasts for $430000d.  $]"},
			{id=28467,title="Section 7"},
			{id=30384,title="Section 16"},
			{id=28466,title="Section 6"},
			{id=28461,title="Speaker Dorlita"},
			{id=28468,title="Section 9",body="$[!8,23\n\nOn Mythic difficulty Magma Waves explode out from the Scrap Cube.  $]"},
