		sections={
			{id=28893,title="Overview",body="The lords of the Silken Court fight as rivals for the queen's favor, alternatingly assaulting their enemies with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:439992|h[Web Bomb]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:440158|h[Reckless Charge]|h|r.\n\nUpon reaching 100 void energy, Takazj ascends into void form and begins to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:450980|h[Shatter Existence]|h|r. \n\nAfter rejoining the battle, Anub'arash begins to summon |cFF2959D3|Hspell:438677|h[Stinging Swarms]|h|r as Takazj evokes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:438355|h[Cataclysmic Entropy]|h|r. \n\nUpon reaching 100 anger, Anub'arash enters a raging fury and unleashes a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:451277|h[Spike Storm]|h|r. \n\nNow with both members of the court at their full power, Anub'arash storms across the chamber with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:440158|h[Reckless Charge]|h|r as Takazj conjures Cataclysmic Entropy."},
			{id=28894,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:450980|h[Shatter Existence]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:451277|h[Spike Storm]|h|r apply heavy absorb shields to their casters.\n$bullet; Players who are |cFF2959D3|Hspell:449857|h[Impaled]|h|r are stunned until their impaling spike is destroyed.\n$bullet; Anub'arash summons scarabs into the chamber with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:438801|h[Call of the Swarm]|h|r."},
			{id=28895,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:438677|h[Stinging Swarm]|h|r transfers to the nearest player or Takazj upon removal.\n$bullet; Anub'arash becomes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:440179|h[Entangled]|h|r if he charges through |cFF2959D3|Hspell:440001|h[Binding Webs]|h|r.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460360|h[Burrowing Eruption]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:442994|h[Unleashed Swarm]|h|r  inflict heavy raid damage."},
			{id=28896,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; Anub'arash's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:438218|h[Piercing Strike]|h|r inflicts heavy Physical damage. \n$bullet; Takazj moves throughout the chamber using |cFF2959D3|Hspell:450045|h[Skittering Leap]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:450483|h[Void Step]|h|r.\n$bullet; The fates of Anub'arash and Skeinspinner Takazj are linked through |cFF2959D3|Hspell:455363|h[Queen's Proclamation]|h|r."},
