			{itemID=225750,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=225730,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=29964,title="Overview",body="Shurrai showers players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:453733|h[Briny Vomit]|h|r before washing away both players and vomit with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:455275|h[Dark Tide]|h|r.\n\nAt 100 energy Shurrai casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:453875|h[Regurgitate Souls]|h|r, summoning Drowned Arathi and shielding himself with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:455639|h[Shroud of the Drowned]|h|r."},
			{id=29965,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:453607|h[Abyssal Strike]|h|r applies a heal absorb equivalent to the amount of damage inflicted.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:455275|h[Dark Tide]|h|r washes away pools of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:453733|h[Briny Vomit]|h|r.\n$bullet;Drowned Arathi inflict a significant amount of damage to Shurrai when slain."},
			{id=29966,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Drowned Arathi inflict |cFF2959D3|Hspell:453863|h[Ocean's Reckoning]|h|r upon death.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:455275|h[Dark Tide]|h|r washes away pools of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:453733|h[Briny Vomit]|h|r.\n$bullet;Drowned Arathi inflict a significant amount of damage to Shurrai when slain."},
			{id=29967,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:455275|h[Dark Tide]|h|r washes away pools of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:453733|h[Briny Vomit]|h|r.\n$bullet;Drowned Arathi inflict a significant amount of damage to Shurrai when slain."},
			{id=29973,title="Drowned Arathi"},
			{id=30063,title="Section 11"},
		},
	},
	[2637]={
		encounterID=2637,
		instanceID=1278,
		order=1,
		name="Kordac, the Dormant Protector",
		lore="Barely functional or even remembered, Kordac's disrepair forces him to remain a dormant observer. Even upon detecting the void somewhere below, he was forced into inaction. But that's changed. The unidentifiable lifeforms who have arrived to the Isle of Dorn are powerful enough to potentially pose a threat to Azeroth. And so he stands against us. And so we stand against him.",
		dungeonEncounterID=2997,
		pin={x=0.5,y=0.5},
		difficultyIDs={14},
		npcIDs={221084},
		displayIDs={118472},
		loot={
			{itemID=225734,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=225735,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=225733,diffs={},faction=-1},
