			{itemID=228868,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=223048,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=30089,title="Overview",body="The Geargrinder begins the encounter encased in |cFF2959D3|Hspell:466615|h[Protective Plating]|h|r, slowly generating energy in preparation for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:471403|h[Unrelenting CAR-nage]|h|r. While atop her war-tank, Vexie calls in Geargrinder Bikers to assist her. When a biker is defeated they surrender their ride, allowing players to unleash a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:459453|h[Blaze of Glory]|h|r and removing an application of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:466615|h[Protective Plating]|h|r. Once all |cFF2959D3|Hspell:466615|h[Protective Plating]|h|r is removed, the Geargrinder suffers a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460603|h[Mechanical Breakdown]|h|r.\n\nWhile broken down, Vexie begins to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460116|h[Tune-Up]|h|r the war-tank and calls Pit Mechanics to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460153|h[Repair]|h|r the Geargrinder. Once fully repaired Vexie commands the Geargrinder to continue its assault!"},
			{id=31555,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Defeated Geargrinder Bikers surrender their bikes, allowing for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:459453|h[Blaze of Glory]|h|r.\n$bullet;Vexie's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460116|h[Tune-Up]|h|r and Pit Mechanics' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460153|h[Repair]|h|r the Geargrinder's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:466615|h[Protective Plating]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={14,17}},
			{id=30090,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Defeated Geargrinder Bikers surrender their bikes, allowing for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:459453|h[Blaze of Glory]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:459627|h[Tank Buster]|h|r leaves an |cFF2959D3|Hspell:468129|h[Oil Slick]|h|r at the caster's location.\n$bullet;Vexie's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460116|h[Tune-Up]|h|r and Pit Mechanics' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460153|h[Repair]|h|r the Geargrinder's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:466615|h[Protective Plating]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=30091,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Defeated Geargrinder Bikers surrender their bikes, allowing for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:459453|h[Blaze of Glory]|h|r.\n$bullet;Vexie's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460116|h[Tune-Up]|h|r and Pit Mechanics' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460153|h[Repair]|h|r the Geargrinder's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:466615|h[Protective Plating]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:460603|h[Mechanical Breakdown]|h|r causes the Geargrinder to take increased damage."},
			{id=30092,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Defeated Geargrinder Bikers surrender their bikes, allowing for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:459453|h[Blaze of Glory]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:459666|h[Spew Oil]|h|r inflicts moderate damage to afflicted players.\n$bullet;While the Geargrinder suffers from a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460603|h[Mechanical Breakdown]|h|r all players take damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460386|h[Backfire]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:460603|h[Mechanical Breakdown]|h|r causes the Geargrinder to take increased damage."},
