		name="Stix Bunkjunker",
		lore="It could be said that no city service is more essential than garbage collection... or at least that's what Stix Bunkjunker would like you to believe. Stix and his cleanup crew have been finding inventive ways to dispose of the city's unwanteds and unmentionables for as long as anyone can remember.",
