		sections={
			{id=30370,title="Overview",body="Stix assaults the players while slowly gaining energy. Upon reaching 100 energy Stix uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464399|h[Electromagnetic Sorting]|h|r, pulling |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464854|h[Garbage Piles]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464865|h[Discarded Doomsplosives]|h|r from the landfill while selecting several players to become |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461536|h[Rolling Rubbish]|h|r.\n\nEventually, Stix forces his mech into |cFF2959D3|Hspell:467117|h[Overdrive]|h|r and operates at |cFF2959D3|Hspell:473227|h[Maximum Output]|h|r until defeated."},
			{id=30371,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1217954|h[Meltdown]|h|r inflicts major damage to Stix's current target, especially if they are affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464112|h[Demolish]|h|r.\n$bullet;Scrapmasters and Junkyard Hyenas can be absorbed by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461536|h[Rolling Rubbish]|h|r, depositing them wherever the ball is destroyed.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:464865|h[Discarded Doomsplosive]|h|r inflicts devastating raidwide damage if not absorbed by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461536|h[Rolling Rubbish]|h|r."},
			{id=30372,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Scrapmasters and Junkyard Hyenas can be absorbed by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461536|h[Rolling Rubbish]|h|r, depositing them wherever the ball is destroyed.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:464149|h[Incinerator]|h|r can turn nearby garbage piles into |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464248|h[Hot Garbage]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:464865|h[Discarded Doomsplosive]|h|r inflicts devastating raidwide damage if not absorbed by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461536|h[Rolling Rubbish]|h|r."},
			{id=30373,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:464399|h[Electromagnetic Sorting]|h|r inflicts significant raidwide damage.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:464149|h[Incinerator]|h|r can turn nearby garbage piles into |cFF2959D3|Hspell:464248|h[Hot Garbage]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:464865|h[Discarded Doomsplosive]|h|r inflicts devastating raidwide damage if not absorbed by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461536|h[Rolling Rubbish]|h|r."},
