		sections={
			{id=30079,title="Overview",body="The One-Armed Bandit assaults players while slowly gaining energy. Upon reaching 100 energy, it uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461060|h[Spin to Win!]|h|r to call upon Reel Assistants bearing various symbol Tokens. Defeating these assistants and depositing their tokens within the One-Armed Bandit determines the result.\n\nAfter all of the valid combinations have been rolled, the One-Armed Bandit overloads and takes control of its own reels using |cFF2959D3|Hspell:465309|h[Cheat to Win!]|h|r in a final attempt to destroy its enemies."},
			{id=30080,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:460472|h[The Big Hit]|h|r inflicts high damage and leaves behind a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460474|h[Shocking Field]|h|r.\n$bullet;Activating a Shock Coil causes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:473009|h[Explosive Shrapnel]|h|r to inflict high damage and absorb nearby |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460474|h[Shocking Fields]|h|r.\n$bullet;If two tokens are not deposited or a repeat combination is detected during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461060|h[Spin to Win!]|h|r, the One-Armed Bandit uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461068|h[Fraud Detected!]|h|r."},
			{id=30081,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Reel Assistants called forth from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461060|h[Spin To Win!]|h|r bear icons that can be slotted back into the One-Armed Bandit.\n$bullet;If two tokens are not deposited or a repeat combination is detected during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461060|h[Spin to Win!]|h|r, the One-Armed Bandit uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461068|h[Fraud Detected!]|h|r.\n$bullet;Standing close to the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460181|h[Pay-Line]|h|r chip will grant |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460444|h[High Roller!]|h|r."},
			{id=30082,title="Healers",body="$bullet;If two tokens are not deposited or a repeat combination is detected during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461060|h[Spin to Win!]|h|r, the One-Armed Bandit uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:461068|h[Fraud Detected!]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:460164|h[Foul Exhaust]|h|r reduces the movement speed of all players and absorbs a large amount of healing.\n$bullet;Standing close to the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460181|h[Pay-Line]|h|r chip will grant |cFF2959D3|Hspell:460444|h[High Roller!]|h|r."},
