		order=7,
		name="Mug'Zee, Heads of Security",
		lore="Buddies from the day they were born, Mug'Zee's two heads are the topper of a giant hulk of an ogre enforcer, specifically hired by Gallywix to oversee his casino's day-to-day activities. In recent weeks, Mug'Zee's been reassigned to keep anyone and everyone out of the Gallagio's innermost chambers.",
