		order=8,
		name="Chrome King Gallywix",
		lore="Having taken a 'strategic retreat,' Jastor Gallywix holed up in the halls of the Gallagio. Whatever Gallywix has been working on, it's guaranteed to be powerful, deadly, and capable of crushing any who oppose him.",
