		sections={
			{id=30486,title="Overview",body="Gallywix gains energy over time, activating The House of Chrome's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:469286|h[Giga Coils]|h|r at max capacity. |cFF2959D3|Hspell:469362|h[Charged Giga Bomb]|h|rs brought to Giga Controls trigger a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:469767|h[Giga Bomb Detonation]|h|r. This causes a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1220846|h[Control Meltdown]|h|r which interrupts Gallywix's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:469286|h[Giga Coils]|h|r. Upon losing both Giga Controls a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1215209|h[Sabotage Zone]|h|r forms.\n\nAdditionally, throughout the encounter Gallywix calls in the most overpaid Darkfuse Cronies to aid him.\n\nAs the battle rages on Gallywix alters and augments his arsenal bringing maniacal mayhem.$[14,15,17$  Upon reaching 50% health Gallywix upgrades his capabilities to eliminates players once and for all. $]"},
			{id=30487,title="Tanks",body="$[15,16$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:465952|h[Big Bad Buncha Bombs]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1214607|h[Bigger Badder Bomb Blast]|h|r additionally create |cFF2959D3|Hspell:466165|h[1500-Pound \"Dud\"]|h|r.$]\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:466340|h[Scatterblast Canisters]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1214607|h[Bigger Badder Bomb Blast]|h|r affect players in Gallywix's frontal direction.\n$bullet;Dying Darkfuse Technicians drop Giga Bombs that go |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1223905|h[Giga BOOM!]|h|r after $1223905D. Gallywix's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:469327|h[Giga Blast]|h|r detonates these immediately.\n$bullet;Gallywix release all |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1220290|h[Trick Shots]|h|r upon reaching $1220290s2 stacks or when changing primary targets."},
			{id=30488,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Player affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1220761|h[Mechengineer's Canisters]|h|r detonate on consumption or expiration causing a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:474447|h[Canister Detonation]|h|r.\n$bullet;Dying Darkfuse Technicians drop Giga Bombs that go |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1223905|h[Giga BOOM!]|h|r after $1223905D. Gallywix's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:469327|h[Giga Blast]|h|r detonates these immediately.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:469362|h[Charged Giga Bomb]|h|rs brought to Giga Controls trigger a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:469767|h[Giga Bomb Detonation]|h|r causing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1220846|h[Control Meltdown]|h|r which interrupts Gallywix's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:469286|h[Giga Coils]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:469286|h[Giga Coils]|h|r, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:466338|h[Zagging Zizzler]|h|r, and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1214369|h[TOTAL DESTRUCTION!!!]|h|r inflict significant damage."},
			{id=30489,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:465952|h[Big Bad Buncha Bombs]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1214607|h[Bigger Badder Bomb Blast]|h|r additionally trigger |cFF2959D3|Hspell:466158|h[Sapper's Satchel]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1214755|h[Overloaded Rockets]|h|r.\n$bullet;Dying Darkfuse Technicians drop Giga Bombs that go |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1223905|h[Giga BOOM!]|h|r after $1223905D. Gallywix's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:469327|h[Giga Blast]|h|r detonates these immediately.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:469362|h[Charged Giga Bomb]|h|rs brought to Giga Controls trigger a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:469767|h[Giga Bomb Detonation]|h|r causing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1220846|h[Control Meltdown]|h|r which interrupts Gallywix's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:469286|h[Giga Coils]|h|r.\n$[15,16$bullet;Sharpshot Sentry can inflict high damage with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:466834|h[Shock Barrage]|h|r when left uncontrolled.$]"},
			{id=30490,title="Stage One: The House of Chrome",body="\"Take a good look at what gold and goblins can getcha.\"\n\nCornered in The House of Chrome Gallywix stands ready to blast foes.",difficultyIDs={14,15,17,220}},
