			{itemID=232731,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=232732,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=31346,title="Overview",body="The Gobfather won't go down without a final fight, scattering Primed Boomcrawlers with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1216505|h[Bombfield]|h|r and knocking back players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1216812|h[Giga-Rocket Slam]|h|r.\n\nAt 100 energy it pulls out all the stops, raining down |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1216709|h[Death From Above]|h|r."},
			{id=31347,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Primed Boomcrawlers explode with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1216577|h[Bomb Voyage]|h|r when stepped on.\n$bullet;The Gobfather inflicts massive damage with its |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1216709|h[Death From Above]|h|r  missiles.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1216687|h[Flaming Flames]|h|r inflicts damage to players in front of The Gobfather."},
			{id=31349,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Primed Boomcrawlers explode with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1216577|h[Bomb Voyage]|h|r when stepped on.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1216656|h[Excessive Pollutants]|h|r continually inflicts damage to all players.\n$bullet;The Gobfather inflicts massive damage with its |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1216709|h[Death From Above]|h|r  missiles."},
			{id=31348,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Primed Boomcrawlers explode with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1216577|h[Bomb Voyage]|h|r when stepped on.\n$bullet;The Gobfather inflicts massive damage with its |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1216709|h[Death From Above]|h|r  missiles.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1216687|h[Flaming Flames]|h|r inflicts damage to players in front of The Gobfather."},
