			{itemID=237528,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=31594,title="Overview",body="The |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1217649|h[Arcanomatrix Atomizer]|h|r will |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1219223|h[Atomize]|h|r all beings not made of energy who come into contact with it.\n\nThe Plexus Sentinel will continue to gain energy while attacking players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1219263|h[Obliteration Arcanocannon]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1219532|h[Eradicating Salvo]|h|r\n\nUpon reaching 100 Energy, the Plexus Sentinel begins channelling |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1220489|h[Protocol: Purge]|h|r as it activates the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1217649|h[Arcanomatrix Atomizer]|h|r"},
			{id=31981,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1219450|h[Manifest Matrices]|h|r leaves behind a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1218625|h[Displacement Matrix]|h|r.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1233110|h[Purging Lightning]|h|r inflicts increasing damage while the Plexus Sentinel's shield holds.\n\n$bullet; The Reshii Wraps allow|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1218148|h[Phase Blinking]|h|r reducing the damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1219223|h[Atomize]|h|r"},
			{id=31982,title="Healers",body="$bullet; The Plexus Sentinel inflicts increasing damage with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1233110|h[Purging Lightning]|h|r during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1220489|h[Protocol: Purge]|h|r.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1219607|h[Eradication Salvo]|h|r inflicts heavy damage to players hit by it.\n\n$bullet; The Reshii Wraps allow|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1218148|h[Phase Blinking]|h|r reducing the damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1219223|h[Atomize]|h|r"},
			{id=31983,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1219263|h[Obliteration Arcanocannon]|h|r inflicts heavy damage to players near the impact.\n\n$bullet; The Reshii Wraps allow|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1218148|h[Phase Blinking]|h|r reducing the damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1219223|h[Atomize]|h|r"},
