		sections={
			{id=32218,title="Overview",body="Soulbinder Naazindhri activates the Binding Chambers throughout the room in order to create waves of Shadowguard. The destructive power of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227276|h[Soulfray Annihilation]|h|r can obliterate her enemies, but may disrupt her chambers' work if caught in its path."},
			{id=32219,title="Tank",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1241100|h[Mystic Lash]|h|r inflicts significant damage to primary target and increases the damage they take.\n$bullet;After completing|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1239988|h[Soulweave Chrysalis]|h|r the Unbound Soul is transformed into a more dangerous Ethereal."},
			{id=32220,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227276|h[Soulfray Annihilation]|h|r can destroy all it touches, whether players or Binding Machines.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1225616|h[Soulfire Convergence]|h|r causes the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226827|h[Soulrend Orb ]|h|r to be violently expelled from the target player's body. If it strikes another player, it inflicts negative effects upon them."},
			{id=32221,title="Healer",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227048|h[Soulfray Annihilation]|h|r can destroy all it touches, whether players or Binding Machines.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1241100|h[Mystic Lash]|h|r inflicts significant damage to primary target, and increase the damage they take.\n$bullet;The Binding Chamber causes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227848|h[Essence Implosion]|h|r while it is broken or opened, inflicting massive damage to all players."},
			{id=32043,title="Section 7"},
