		lore="Adarus Duskblaze is a demon hunter brimming with abyssal power, seeking to devour the void energy surrounding Manaforge Omega. Together he and his deadly allies, Ilyssa Darksorrow and Velaryn Bloodwrath, will destroy all who oppose them.",
