		sections={
			{id=31786,title="Overview",body="Adarus tears open a rift to the void and brands players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1222232|h[Devourer's Ire]|h|r. Adarus will focus his assault on the players bearing this mark.\n\nVelaryn singes any who stand in her path with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1218103|h[Eye Beam]|h|r and lunges towards her prey with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227809|h[The Hunt]|h|r.\n\nIlyssa cleaves her target's essence with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1241833|h[Fracture]|h|r and feasts on their rended soul with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1242259|h[Spirit Bomb]|h|r.\n\nUpon reaching 100 Fury, the Demon Hunters unleash their true power and enter |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1228381|h[Metamorphosis]|h|r."},
			{id=31787,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1218103|h[Eye Beam]|h|r singes Velaryn's current target with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1221490|h[Fel-Singed]|h|r and blasts them away.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1241833|h[Fracture]|h|r cleaves their target's soul into fragments which Ilyssa will attempt to consume with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1242259|h[Spirit Bomb]|h|r.\n$bullet;Adarus will |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227355|h[Voidstep]|h|r to new locations, summoning images which slice open the fabric of the void with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227685|h[Hungering Slash]|h|r and leave behind |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1235045|h[Encroaching Oblivion]|h|r."},
			{id=31788,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Adarus continually casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1234565|h[Consume]|h|r at the players bearing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1222232|h[Devourer's Ire]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1241833|h[Fracture]|h|r cleaves their target's soul into fragments which Ilyssa will attempt to consume with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1242259|h[Spirit Bomb]|h|r.\n$bullet;Adarus will |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227355|h[Voidstep]|h|r to new locations, summoning images which slice open the fabric of the void with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227685|h[Hungering Slash]|h|r and leave behind |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1235045|h[Encroaching Oblivion]|h|r."},
			{id=31789,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Adarus continually casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1234565|h[Consume]|h|r at the players bearing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1222232|h[Devourer's Ire]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1241833|h[Fracture]|h|r cleaves their target's soul into fragments which Ilyssa will attempt to consume with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1242259|h[Spirit Bomb]|h|r.\n$bullet;Adarus will |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227355|h[Voidstep]|h|r to new locations, summoning images which slice open the fabric of the void with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227685|h[Hungering Slash]|h|r and leave behind |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1235045|h[Encroaching Oblivion]|h|r."},
