			{itemID=243365,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=246727,diffs={91529,109},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=31569,title="Overview",body="The Nexus-King readies his mace to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224787|h[Conquer]|h|r armies as images of the Royal Voidwing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1225010|h[Behead]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1225016|h[Besiege]|h|r insurgents at his command. Those who lack zeal are destined for servitude when Salhadaar |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224906|h[Invokes the Oath]|h|r.\n\nBy regal edict, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224764|h[Oath-Breakers]|h|r are devoured between cosmic jaws and razed to atoms by the Royal Voidwing's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1228163|h[Dimension Breath]|h|r. Salhadaar governs the battle from atop his steed, rallying elite Shadowguard reinforcements.\n\nWhen |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1228265|h[King's Hunger]|h|r takes reign, Salhadaar's loyal drake is called upon for ultimate sacrifice. Violet skies blacken and galaxies of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248137|h[Dark Stars]|h|r form at the strike of a gavel as the Nexus-King plunges the world into twilight."},
			{id=31570,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Salhadaar executes a combination of deadly attacks during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224776|h[Subjugation Rule]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1234529|h[Cosmic Maw]|h|r increases damage taken by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1228163|h[Dimension Breath]|h|r.\n$bullet;Salhadaar's primary targets of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1225319|h[Galactic Smash]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226024|h[Starkiller Swing]|h|r are |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226417|h[Starshattered]|h|r."},
			{id=32623,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224737|h[Oath-Bound]|h|r players are vulnerable to conversion into |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224767|h[King's Thrall]|h|r.\n$bullet;Manaforged Titans cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1230302|h[Self-Destruct]|h|r, inflicting massive damage to all players.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226024|h[Starkiller Swing]|h|r erupts in a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226042|h[Starkiller Nova]|h|r unless consumed by a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248137|h[Dark Star]|h|r."},
			{id=31572,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224737|h[Oath-Bound]|h|r players are vulnerable to conversion into |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224767|h[King's Thrall]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227529|h[Banishment]|h|r, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1228053|h[Reap]|h|r, and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226362|h[Twilight Scar]|h|r inflict heavy damage over time to affected players.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226024|h[Starkiller Swing]|h|r erupts in a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226042|h[Starkiller Nova]|h|r unless consumed by a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248137|h[Dark Star]|h|r."},
			{id=31573,title="Stage One: Oath-Breakers",body="Salhadaar forces players under oath and tests their will against the void."},
