		sections={
			{id=33678,title="Overview",body="Fractillus calls forth |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226089|h[Crystal Nexuses]|h|r that amplify the power of the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1233657|h[Nether Prism]|h|r. If six nexuses are allowed to amplify a single prism's beam, Fractillus will be empowered with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1233917|h[Crystaline Overcharge]|h|r.\n\nUpon reaching 100 energy, Fractillus will use its |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1227376|h[Shattering Backhand]|h|r to knock several players away, shattering any |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226089|h[Crystal Nexus]|h|r in their path."},
			{id=32121,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Players knocked back by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1220394|h[Shattering Backhand]|h|r will shatter |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226089|h[Crystal Nexuses]|h|r they hit in to.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224414|h[Crystalline Shockwave]|h|r places a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226089|h[Crystal Nexuses]|h|r extending the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1233657|h[Nether Prism's]|h|r energy towards Fractillus."},
			{id=32122,title="Healers",body="$bullet; Players knocked back by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1220394|h[Shattering Backhand]|h|r will shatter |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226089|h[Crystal Nexuses]|h|r they hit in to.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224414|h[Crystalline Shockwave]|h|r places a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226089|h[Crystal Nexuses]|h|r extending the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1233657|h[Nether Prism's]|h|r energy towards Fractillus."},
