		order=0,
		name="Reshanor, The Untethered",
		lore="The ethereals of K'aresh first witnessed this destructive maw of the void after Dimensius's attack. They believe Reshanor has manifested as their eternal punishment - for it comes back around to keep eating them and their planet as he grows infinitely bigger over the years.",
		dungeonEncounterID=3184,
		pin={x=0.5,y=0.5},
