		sections={
			{id=32198,title="Overview",body="Reshanor's throat surges with dark, twisted energy, unleashing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1237893|h[Veilshatter Roars]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1237905|h[Twilight Breaths]|h|r. His unstable presence conjures a raging |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226380|h[Voidstorm]|h|r.\n\nWhen his energy wanes, Reshanor retreats into Untethered Space to feed on arcane forces - tearing open reality and allowing void creatures to spill forth."},
			{id=32199,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1237893|h[Veilshatter Roar]|h|r inflicts heavy damage to all players and interrupts those casting.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1243941|h[Erratic Rifts]|h|r allow players to follow Reshanor into Untethered Space.\n$bullet; Players with high stacks of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1237906|h[Void Corruption]|h|r require significant healing."},
			{id=32200,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1237893|h[Veilshatter Roar]|h|r inflicts heavy damage to all players and interrupts those casting.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1243941|h[Erratic Rifts]|h|r allow players to follow Reshanor into Untethered Space.\n$bullet; Void creatures are called during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1237288|h[Untethered Retreat]|h|r."},
